@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / conditional — Deployment approval and actual target outcome
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> PendingApproval : exact artifact / target / configuration intent
PendingApproval --> ApprovedContext : actual target approval + current authority
ApprovedContext --> PendingApproval : relevant inputs / authority change
ApprovedContext --> Deploying : guarded eligible attributable dispatch
Deploying --> Verifying : actual applied-state observations available
Deploying --> Unknown : target effect uncertain
Verifying --> ConfirmedLive : all actual required target/data/health checks pass
Verifying --> RecoveryAssessment : failure / partial incompatible outcome
Unknown --> RecoveryAssessment : reconcile same target attempt first
RecoveryAssessment --> RecoveredPrior : separately authorized compatible rollback confirmed
RecoveryAssessment --> ForwardRepaired : separately authorized forward recovery confirmed
RecoveryAssessment --> Unknown : evidence insufficient / recovery unresolved
note bottom of RecoveryAssessment
 No generic automatic rollback guarantee.
 Irreversible data effects may prohibit old-code restoration.
 A running old version is not proof all data/effects were undone.
end note

@enduml
